{"product_id":"j-10c-earbuds","title":"J-10C Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2 data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"241\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"241\"\u003eJ-10 C Limited Edition Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"261\"\u003eJ-10 C Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are a special tribute to the Pakistan Air Force’s historic 6-0 victory over India—a moment of pride, power, and precision. Engineered for performance and crafted with sleek design, they blend immersive audio, military-grade clarity, and everyday comfort for champions at heart.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"544\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"577\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"616\"\u003eLimited Edition Tribute Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Inspired by the spirit of victory and valor, celebrating PAF's 6-0 triumph.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"805\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"722\"\u003eCrystal‑Clear Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quad-mic ENC noise reduction for rich, balanced sound and superior call clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"917\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"834\"\u003eLong-Lasting Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enjoy 5–6 hours of continuous play and up to 20–24 hours with the charging case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"992\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"944\"\u003eFast USB-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully recharges in 1–2 hours via USB-C input.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1112\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003eStable Bluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth, low-latency connectivity with support for AAC\/SBC audio decoding and 10m+ range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1214\"\u003e🎮 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1138\"\u003eGame Mode Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Activate low latency with 4 quick taps for competitive audio performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eSmart Assistant Enabled\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compatible with Siri and Google Assistant for seamless voice control.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1412\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1352\"\u003eResponsive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Manage music, calls, and volume with effortless gestures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1511\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1442\"\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Resistant to sweat and light rain—ideal for commutes and workouts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1551\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1551\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"2069\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1564\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 45 g (earbuds + case)\u003cbr data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1610\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40 mAh × 2 (earbuds) + 700 mAh (case)\u003cbr data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1651\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1664\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–6 hours (single charge) \/ 20–24 hours (with case)\u003cbr data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1719\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1736\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 120 hours\u003cbr data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1749\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1767\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1–2 hours (5 V\/300 mA input)\u003cbr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1821\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.4 (range \u0026gt; 10 m)\u003cbr data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1843\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1860\"\u003eAuto Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes\u003cbr data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1867\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1886\"\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e AAC, SBC\u003cbr data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1898\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1921\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.4 GHz\u003cbr data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1932\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1946\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32 Ω ± 10%\u003cbr data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1960\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1976\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 105 ± 3 dB\u003cbr data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"1990\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2006\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Quad mic ENC noise cancellation\u003cbr data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2041\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2062\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2074\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2098\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2098\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2145\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2145\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003ePlay\/Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2189\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2189\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2161\"\u003eNext Song\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2236\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2236\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2209\"\u003ePrevious Song\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2279\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2279\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2251\"\u003eVolume +\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2321\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2321\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2294\"\u003eVolume –\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2343\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press either earbud (2 sec)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2426\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2426\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2396\"\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Tap either earbud 4 times\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2481\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2452\"\u003eAnswer\/Hang Up Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2528\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2528\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2544\"\u003ePower Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Touch \u0026amp; hold for 7 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2580\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2616\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2616\"\u003eWhy Choose J-10 C Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2945\"\u003eJ-10 C isn't just a pair of earbuds—it's a statement. Designed to commemorate Pakistan Air Force’s iconic 6-0 victory, these earbuds merge military inspiration with top-tier functionality. Whether you're gaming, on a call, or vibing to your favorite tracks, J-10 C delivers sound with purpose. Own the legacy. Hear the victory.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50352552509718,"sku":"25746","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"J-10 C Gift Box","offer_id":51621432066326,"sku":"25884","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_38e06a8b-7a6e-481a-a837-149460b8805a.webp?v=1785237507","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/j-10c-earbuds","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}